# Calamares, to install the live system to disk, with Debian's settings
# (adapted by 0060-calamares.hook.chroot). Calamares copies the live
# system to the target, so it also needs what d-i's pkgsel installs there
# from dtb-loader.list.binary: the Stubble packages, for postinst.sh's
# dtb-loader step.
calamares
calamares-settings-debian
stubble
systemd-boot-efi
